 SYSVIEW_CONSTRAINTS_TB_COL5_FKEY     | F               | SYSVIEW_CONSTRAINTS_TB |                               |                               | SYSVIEW_CONSTRAINTS_REF_COL_KEY | NO ACTION   | NOT DEFERRABLE | IMMEDIATE | VALIDATE  | USER NAME | SYSVIEW_CONSTRAINTS_REF_COL_KEY | 
