 SYSVIEW_TAB_PARTITIONS_PART1 | NO        | SYSVIEW_TAB_PARTITIONS_PART1_4 | 0                  | FOR VALUES FROM (61) TO (100)            | 29                | 4                  | 0        | YES     | 117      | 1      | 27          | DISABLED
